<#
============================================================================
  create-cart-page.ps1
  Saachi AI (SAI2) - Web App

  Creates:
    apps/web/components/cart/CartHeader.tsx
    apps/web/components/cart/CartItemCard.tsx
    apps/web/components/cart/OrderSummary.tsx
    apps/web/app/(marketing)/cart/page.tsx     -> route: /cart

  Run from the SAI2 monorepo root, e.g.:
    PS D:\Rozmarrah-CUST\Saim Ashraf\Saachi AI\Working\Code\Saachi_ai_1\SAI2> .\create-cart-page.ps1

  Notes:
  - Each file is embedded as Base64 and written via WriteAllBytes to avoid
    here-string corruption (square brackets, curly braces, backticks,
    parenthesized route-group folders like "(marketing)").
  - Uses -Path (not -LiteralPath) for New-Item/Test-Path/Get-Content, since
    -LiteralPath was rejected by New-Item in this environment (likely a
    custom profile function shadowing the built-in cmdlet). Parentheses are
    not PowerShell wildcard characters, so -Path is safe here.
  - All colors/spacing use existing design tokens
    (apps/web/lib/design-system/tokens.ts -> var(--token-color-*),
    var(--token-shadow-*)). Nothing is hardcoded -- re-theme via tokens.ts.
  - Uses Ant Design (Button, Input) for the transactional coupon/checkout
    controls, matching the rest of the web app's form conventions.
  - Cart badge count and subtotal/tax/total are computed from the item
    array client-side (not static strings), so removing an item updates
    the whole summary live.
============================================================================
#>

